<title>ITALY: Italy records bop surplus in July.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop surplus in July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 4.0 billion lire surplus in July, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     July 96	June 96    July 95</p>
<p> Total			    +4	 +6,846	 -217</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +24,558	+24,557     +7,615</p>
<p> Capital movements	-5,250	 -1,405     -4,863</p>
<p>  -Year to date		393	 +7,721     +1,712</p>
